{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/977076-one-mind-two-thoughts","id":977076,"title":"One Mind, Two Thoughts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-27T01:53:20-07:00","id":977076,"title":"One Mind, Two Thoughts","content":"Is it possible to use this spell to simultaneously enter the Astral and exist in the physical world?<br /> What about using it to simultaneously exist as a Psychic Projection + continue occupying your body?<br /> <br /> RAW, it doesn't seem like it'd allow this, but from reading the way the spell is described it seems like it should. Engaging with the Astral and as a psychic projection are both mental tasks.<br /> If not, what kind of spell would you require to do this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T02:31:00-07:00","id":977080,"title":"","content":"Wasn't the Parliament of the Needle from Soul Cage into this?<br /> iirc, the members of that legacy could function in the astral and the physical simultaneously because of it.<br /> Forgive me if I'm mistaken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11641,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","user":"Yelesom","date":". 09-27-2016, 05:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11641-yelesom","name":"Yelesom","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11641_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"121"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T02:36:59-07:00","id":977081,"title":"","content":"The Dreamspeakers can, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Dave Brookshaw</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14-dave-brookshaw","name":"Dave Brookshaw","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2081"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T02:55:54-07:00","id":977082,"title":"","content":"Exist simultaneously yes, but they can only take their turn in one or the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T15:30:53-07:00","id":977431,"title":"","content":"In 1ed if you add Space the character can actually be in multiple places at the same time, though only one of those places would have a soul and the ability to use magic. Mind magic was used to allow each place to act independently, without it only one could act in any given turn.<br /> Astral Space is all mental so you might argue that Space isn't necessary.<br /> \u200bPersonally I would leave this in the hands of Legacies, keep it special.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6084-2pttakrill","name":"2ptTakrill","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"942"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-27T16:40:41-07:00","id":977467,"title":"","content":"Technically, no, you project an image. Mind just manipulates the image so it appears to be doing different things and allows you to observe from several locations simultaneously, but you can only act physically or cast spells in one location.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}